## Background Theory

### Data Visualization in IoT
IoT devices generate continuous streams of raw data. Direct interpretation is difficult, so visualization converts these values into charts and graphs that reveal patterns, anomalies, and trends.

### API‑Driven Architecture
Frontend dashboards interact with backend services through REST APIs. This separation ensures modularity, scalability, and easier maintenance.

### Dashboards
Dashboards act as monitoring panels, presenting real‑time and historical data in a user‑friendly format. They simplify performance tracking and trend analysis.

### Data Filtering
Filters allow users to focus on specific ranges or time periods. This improves responsiveness and ensures relevant insights are highlighted.

